=== (a) spin-2 exchange between point masses with relative Lorentz factor gamma ===
  massive/massless numerator ratio at rest: 4/3  (the 4/3 of alpha = (4/3)(M_f u/M_g)^2)
  ratio relative to rest, as gamma -> oo: 3/4
  ratio relative to rest, small beta = v_rel/c: 1 - beta**2/2 + beta**4/2 + O(beta**5)
  each exchange alone, relative to rest: massless 1 + 2*beta**2 + O(beta**4) ; massive 1 + 3*beta**2/2 + O(beta**4)
  v_rel = 30.0 km/s: fractional change of the X/graviton ratio = -5.007e-09
  v_rel = 120.0 km/s: fractional change of the X/graviton ratio = -8.011e-08
  v_rel = 625.0 km/s: fractional change of the X/graviton ratio = -2.173e-06

